#       Label-associated Aadhaar numbers do NOT require
#       Verhoeff validation.
#
#       This is intentional because a form may contain
#       a test/synthetic/incorrect Aadhaar number.
#
#
# 3. Other 12-digit numbers:
#
#       Must pass Verhoeff before being considered Aadhaar.
#
#
# 4. Full Aadhaar numbers are NEVER written to TXT.
#
# ============================================================


